Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool_full","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a robust DBA combination on pool4 to see if iterative refinement beats the current median pool4.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool4","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a robust median over pool2 to see if adding ARIMA and CWT_rf improves further.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool2"}

Thought: Test a trimmed‑mean over pool4 to see if trimming outlier models improves over the current median pool4 leader.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool4","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a robust median over pool3 to see if adding ARIMA, ETS, catboost improves over current leader.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool3"}

Thought: Test a simple best_single hypothesis with the top-ranked model DWT_rf to see if a single strong model can beat the robust median pool4.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"DWT_rf"}

Thought: Try a DBA combination on the smallest, most stable pool1 to see if iterative refinement beats the best single DWT_rf.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool1","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a plain mean over the smaller pool4 to see if reducing model set improves robustness.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool4"}

Thought: Test a DBA combination on pool2 to see if refining over a broader, more stable set improves over the current median pool4 leader.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool2","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using inverse error weights on pool4 to see if it beats the current median leader.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool4","weights":"inverse_error"}

